42
00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:11.820
- One, two...
- Buckle my shoe.

43
00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:12.450
Very good.

44
00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.430
- Three, four...
- Shut the door.

45
00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:16.190
- Five, six...
- Pick up the sticks.

46
00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:18.830
Wow! You've learned it all.

47
00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:20.530
